    {
      "extracted_at": "2026-08-10T14:02:58Z",
      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "initiation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "The company estimates its average worldwide oil-equivalent production in 2023, assuming a Brent crude oil price of $80 per barrel, to be flat to up three percent compared to 2022.",
            "entity_name": "CVX FY2023 Worldwide Oil-Equivalent Production Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "As one of the largest producers in the Permian Basin, Chevron continues to capitalize on its advantaged portfolio in west Texas and southeast New Mexico with an outlook of one million barrels of net oil equivalent production per day by 2025.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Permian Basin 1 MBOPD Production Target by 2025",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Chevron divested its assets in the Eagle Ford Shale in Texas in March 2022.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Eagle Ford Shale Divestiture (March 2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In May 2022, Chevron acquired a 50 percent interest in the Bayou Bend Carbon Capture and Sequestration hub in the Gulf of Mexico, covering over 40,000 acres.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Bayou Bend CCS Hub Acquisition (May 2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In addition to ongoing emission reduction and water handling initiatives, construction of a 50 percent joint venture solar power project in New Mexico to supply renewable energy for our oil and gas operations was completed and is expected to be operational in the first half of 2023.",
            "entity_name": "CVX New Mexico Solar Power Joint Venture (2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In 2022, Chevron signed an agreement to sell the company's interest in all Myanmar assets and exit the country, with an expected closing date in the second half of 2023.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Myanmar Asset Sale Agreement (2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In May 2022, Chevron divested its 40 percent operated interest in OML 86 and OML 88.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Nigeria OML 86 and OML 88 Divestiture (May 2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In September 2022, Chevron acquired an 80 percent-owned and operated interest in PEL90 (Block 2813B) in the Orange Basin, offshore Namibia.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Namibia PEL90 Acquisition (September 2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In November 2022, the Department of Treasury's Office of Foreign Assets Control issued a six-month self-renewing general license authorizing the company to lift production from its four nonoperated affiliate joint ventures in Venezuela for delivery to the United States.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Venezuela OFAC General License (November 2022)",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron's strategy is to leverage our strengths to safely deliver lower carbon energy to a growing world. Our primary objective is to deliver higher returns, lower carbon and superior shareholder value in any business environment. We are building on our capabilities, assets and customer relationships as we aim to lead in lower carbon intensity oil, products and natural gas, as well as advance new products and solutions that reduce the carbon emissions of major industries.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Lower Carbon Intensity Strategy",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron believes human ingenuity has the power to solve difficult problems when diverse people, ideas and experiences come together in an inclusive environment. Chevron reinforces the values of diversity and inclusion through recruitment and talent development, equitable selection processes, community partnerships and supplier diversity.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Diversity and Inclusion Commitment",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
